[00:17.50]1. Doubt and fear surround me—
[00:21.68]The way ahead not clear.
[00:26.06]Through uncertainty you guide me;
[00:31.02]I know you’re always near.
[00:37.74]Life may not be easy,
[00:41.86]But this I know is true:
[00:46.20]You’re the God who’s ever loyal;
[00:51.24]My life is safe with you.
[00:57.02](Chorus)
[00:57.02]Jehovah, give me eyes of faith
[01:02.42]And help me always see
[01:06.72]There are more with us than against us.
[01:13.10]Courageous let me be.
[01:17.90]Courage, give me courage;
[01:21.66]With courage, I’ll endure.
[01:27.50]Jehovah, give me courage;
[01:31.78]Your victory is sure.
[01:41.14]2. Feeling fear is human.
[01:45.02]In my own strength, I’m frail.
[01:49.42]You have been my rock and refuge;
[01:54.48]Your power never fails.
[02:00.82]Help me be courageous,
[02:05.22]And let my heart be brave.
[02:09.86]Lasting harm can never hold me—
[02:14.74]No prison, gate, or grave.
[02:19.86](Chorus)
